## The first Green run and the Red defect

The first full Green command exited 1 with 9 failures, all in
`src/lib/tutor-commission.settlement.adversarial.test.ts`. Every failure printed
`variant: module needsOwnStudents settlement zero`.

The cause was a committed Red test defect. `settledVariant` (lines 202..206) and line 438 pinned
`"zero"` while line 613 pinned `"needsOwnStudents"` for the same input shape. No implementation
could pass both lines.

Green stopped, committed the implementation as `fa8ad4fd3`, and asked for a Mid Red retry. Green
did not edit a test file.

